{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deadlight Manor</strong> is a claustrophobic, stylized survival horror where community is everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By day you scavenge for supplies. By night you fight for survival inside the manor \u2014 repairing barricades, deploying traps, and battling swarms of Hollowed. Switch between survivors with unique abilities and face terrifying mutated foes like the Screamer and the Bound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Squad Survival</strong>: Solo or online co-op against endless waves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Twitch Integration</strong>: Let your audience vote in real time to spawn enemies, drop resources, or trigger chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Competitive Leaderboards</strong>: Climb global rankings and prove your squad can outlast the night.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controlled Chaos</strong>: Stylized horror with traps, explosions, and Deadlight-fueled powers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability by Design</strong>: Roguelike upgrades, seasonal resets, and community-driven challenges.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc5 <i>Launching November 2026 \u2014 Wishlist now and survive the night.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3999370?t=1758152922","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3999370?t=1758152922","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999370/db0d3c937712e82355ecc1cb85fb07195f46ff4d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758152922","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999370/db0d3c937712e82355ecc1cb85fb07195f46ff4d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758152922","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description"